// Luna's colour grade (src/look/grade.js), applied after the ACES curve in display-linear light. It runs in every
// fragment on the tiers that draw straight to the screen (low, phone): kept to one square root and a few dozen
// operations (the first form, a curve on each channel, cost about twice as much; same picture within 0.3 / 255).
